            ╔═ Vix ══════════════════════════════════════╗            
            ║                                            ║            
            ║ Moving the cursor                          ║            
            ║ Move the cursor one tile each way.         ║            
            ║ The turn can't end until the list is done. ║            
            ║                                            ║            
            ║ [x] Move it up: ↑                          ║            
            ║ [ ] Move it down: ↓                        ║            
            ║ [x] Move it left: ←                        ║            
            ║ [ ] Move it right: →                       ║            
            ║                                            ║            
            ║ 2 of 4 done                                ║            
